Training examples have strong negative responses on species, consciousness,
humanity and nations. This program recognizes a small related vocabulary,
including some Chinese/Japanese forms, and adjusts a few immediate phrases:
'human being' versus 'is being', 'in mind', and Soviet/European unions.
It joins alphabetic word pieces, resets at document boundaries, and otherwise
predicts a small background value. Two chat delimiters have separate baselines.
Many weaker, context-dependent activations are not modeled.
