words and Arabic particles get larger responses. Thai text has a positive
background, increased on pieces of common grammatical words. Ordinary text
has a near-zero background. Values are approximate training averages; this
is a lexical approximation, not a claim that all these words mean 'or'.
Within each document, a Vietnamese cue enables ambiguous words such as 'ra'
